(_in money_, have to expend г100.  But suppose) Tj T*
(Consols to be at 108 \(as they are at present\) she) Tj T*
(would have to pay г108 for the same annuity.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    Tables relating to annuities on joint lives and) Tj T*
(to deferred annuities may be obtained at the) Tj T*
(National Debt Office, 19, Old Jewry, London, by) Tj T*
(application direct, or through a bank.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    No person under the age of fifteen can be ap-) Tj T*
(pointed the nominee for any life annuity.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    Life annuities are payable quarterly at the) Tj T*
(National Debt Office, in the form of a warrant) Tj T*
(on the Bank of England, either on personal) Tj T*
(demand, or through a bank by Power of Attor-) Tj T*
(ney; or they can be transmitted to the pro-) Tj T*
(prietor by post.  The fixed dates are the fifth of) Tj T*
(January, the fifth of April, the fifth of July, and) Tj T*
(the fifth of October in each year.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    The first quarterly payment of annuities will) Tj T*
(become due as follows, namely:  On annuities) Tj T*
(purchased between the first of December and) Tj T*
(the last day of February, on the fifth of April) Tj T*
(next following the day of purchase.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    Between the first of March and the last day of) Tj T*
(May, on the fifth of July next following.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    Between the first of June and the last day of) Tj T*
(August, on the fifth of October next following.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    Between the first of September and the last) Tj T*
(day of November, on the fifth of January next) Tj T*
(following.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    No sum less than г100 of stock or money can) Tj T*
(be received in the first instance, but it may be) Tj T*
(added to subsequently in sums of not less than) Tj T*
(г20.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    Upon the expiration of any life annuity a) Tj T*
(sum equal to one-fourth of the annuity \(over and) Tj T*
(above all quarterly arrears thereof\) will be paid) Tj T*
(to the representatives of the annuitant, if) Tj T*
(claimed within two years after such expiration.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    Very heavy penalties attach to persons) Tj T*
(making false statements or declarations in) Tj T*
(respect of the purchase of an annuity.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
