(    INSURANCE OFFICE ANNUITIES.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    Some of the Insurance Offices grant imme-) Tj T*
(diate annuities.  Of course, in purchasing a life) Tj T*
(annuity from an Insurance Office, it is necessary) Tj T*
(to ensure as far as is humanly possible that an) Tj T*
(annuity will be paid for life.  This not only de-) Tj T*
(pends upon the present solvency of the company,) Tj T*
(but upon that solvency being maintained.  There) Tj T*
(is not much difficulty, however, in selecting) Tj T*
(from amongst the numerous well-established) Tj T*
(companies, with proper advice, one that will) Tj T*
(answer every requirement.  The following table) Tj T*
(shows the amount of an annuity granted by the) Tj T*
(undermentioned companies for every г100 paid.) Tj T*
(The age last birthday is that upon which the pay-) Tj T*
(ment is based, and the initial letters M. and F.) Tj T*
(indicate the rates for male and female lives.) Tj T*
(The ages quoted range from 50 to 70 years, but) Tj T*
(the terms for purchasing an annuity at any age) Tj T*
(can be obtained at the Insurance Office.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    By a few companies, distinguished thus \(!\),) Tj T*
(the proportionate amount of annuity is payable) Tj T*
(to the day of death.) Tj T*
