() Tj T*
(    The interest on these loans is usually sent) Tj T*
(direct to the stock-holders, by means of an order) Tj T*
(on a bank.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    COLONIAL GOVERNMENT SECURITIES.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    Loans made to the various Colonies of Great) Tj T*
(Britain have always been a favourite mode) Tj T*
(of investing money, as they command a better) Tj T*
(rate of interest, at least they have done so) Tj T*
(in the past, although the confidence which the) Tj T*
(Colonies have succeeded in inspiring now) Tj T*
(enables them to borrow money at a low rate of) Tj T*
(interest.  At the same time the old stocks have) Tj T*
(advanced to a very considerable premium.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    Experience has shown that, so far, the invest-) Tj T*
(ment has been a safe one, although great fluc-) Tj T*
(tuations have from time to time taken place in) Tj T*
(the value of some of the stocks, owing to a) Tj T*
(check in prosperity, depression of trade, or) Tj T*
(diminished confidence in the stability of the) Tj T*
(Colony from various causes.  These transient) Tj T*
(clouds have, however, in time, passed away, and) Tj T*
(confidence has again been established.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    The investor should be able readily to distin-) Tj T*
(guish between those Colonies which are perma-) Tj T*
(nently settled and not likely to be seriously) Tj T*
(affected by any passing crisis, and others in a) Tj T*
(less fortunate or advanced position.  And he) Tj T*
(would do well, if adversity should at any time) Tj T*
(overtake a Colony, and so send down the value) Tj T*
(of its stock, to avoid selling out in a panic, but) Tj T*
(to consider whether the circumstances are such) Tj T*
(that the crisis may pass off at no distant date,) Tj T*
(and confidence be restored.  It should be remem-) Tj T*
(bered that there are always speculators who, at) Tj T*
(such times, endeavour to intensify a crisis, in) Tj T*
(order that prices may be forced down, and that) Tj T*
(they may be thereby enabled to acquire stocks) Tj T*
(at low prices from timid holders.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    There are two modes of investing in these) Tj T*
(securities,) Tj T*
(    1. Inscribed or Registered Stock.) Tj T*
(    2. Bonds.) Tj T*
