(any amount can be invested, and the same is) Tj T*
(registered in the books of the Bank of England) Tj T*
(or elsewhere, in the name of the investor, in the) Tj T*
(same way as the Government Funds.  The divi-) Tj T*
(dend or interest is sent to the owner's address) Tj T*
(by an order payable at a bank, half-yearly or) Tj T*
(quarterly, as the case may be, or it may, on) Tj T*
(written instructions being sent to the agents, be) Tj T*
(transmitted to the credit of the account of the) Tj T*
(holder at his own bankers periodically.  This is) Tj T*
(by far the best plan; it saves trouble and risk,) Tj T*
(and, for the matter of that, something in postage.) Tj T*
(It is, moreover, the method much preferred) Tj T*
(by the agents themselves, and it involves no) Tj T*
(additional expense.) Tj T*
